 "lines": {"toy_seesaw_scoop_snow_off_the_feet": ["Dug the legs out. The seesaw's grateful, in a wooden way.", "Snow's gone. It'll hold a grudge, same as me."], "toy_seesaw_drum_along_the_plank": ["Plank's got rhythm. I've got a bill. We're a band.", "Tok tok tok. Percussion is the only honest job."], "toy_seesaw_tug_the_handle": ["Pulled the lever. Nothing happened. Engineering.", "Whatever that's for, it isn't for ducks."], "toy_seesaw_sniff_the_plank": ["Splinters, rain and someone else's turn.", "Smells like a playground that gave up."], "toy_seesaw_peck_up_the_rungs": ["Eight rungs. Decoration with ambitions.", "Pecked every one. Still on the ground. Okay, then."], "toy_seesaw_wait_for_a_partner": ["It takes two. I brought one. Maths is brutal.", "The far seat's empty. It's honest about it, at least."], "toy_seesaw_sulk_at_the_far_leg": ["Built for two. Used by one. A metaphor, probably.", "Don't say it's only a seesaw. Let me have this."], "toy_seesaw_chant_see_saw": ["See. Saw. Repeat. The lyrics aren't the point.", "I did the chorus. The seesaw did nothing, as usual."], "toy_seesaw_heaved_it_and_got_bonked": ["Lifted it. Admired it. It disagreed with me.", "Fair. I'd drop on me too."], "toy_seesaw_drum_the_legs": ["Tune's rubbish. The legs never learned the words.", "Four notes, all damp. Still a hit."], "toy_seesaw_pat_the_plank_like_a_horse": ["Good plank. Who's a good plank. Not an answer.", "Patted it end to end. It didn't buck. Wooden manners."], "toy_seesaw_peck_the_hinge_cap": ["It winked first. I'm only returning the favour.", "Pecked a wink. Strange feeling. Worth it."], "toy_seesaw_chin_on_the_plank_edge": ["Leaning on the bar. One duck, one plank, no drinks.", "Usual order: nothing. Make it a double."], "toy_seesaw_bounced_off_the_end_of_the_bar": ["Bounced myself out of my own game. Impressive, in a way.", "The bar says that's enough fun. The bar's a snob."]},
